cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the software."
title: "Companion code for 'The Semantic Turn in Metaheuristics'"
abstract: >-
  Runnable reference implementation accompanying the tutorial "The Semantic Turn
  in Metaheuristics: A Tutorial on Conditioning, Building, and Choosing LLM
  Variation Operators." Includes the build-and-validate loop (Algorithm 1), a
  transient solution-level operator (TSP), and an amortized code-emitting operator
  (online bin packing), all runnable offline via a deterministic mock LLM.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
